ssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6MOdSA","createdAt":"2024-09-16T10:59:15Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-16T10:59:15Z","publishedAt":"2024-09-16T10:59:15Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6MW5-Y","createdAt":"2024-09-17T07:59:24Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T07:59:24Z","publishedAt":"2024-09-17T07:59:24Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6MW8P2","createdAt":"2024-09-17T08:03:57Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T08:03:57Z","publishedAt":"2024-09-17T08:03:57Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6MWFjf","createdAt":"2024-09-17T06:01:10Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T06:01:10Z","publishedAt":"2024-09-17T06:01:10Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6MWJA1","createdAt":"2024-09-17T06:11:11Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T06:11:11Z","publishedAt":"2024-09-17T06:11:11Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6MWJko","createdAt":"2024-09-17T06:12:49Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T06:13:29Z","publishedAt":"2024-09-17T06:12:49Z","lastEditedAt":"2024-09-17T06:13:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"editor":{"login":"ganluo960214","url":"https://github.com/ganluo960214"},"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":2,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpHOT-Rf8Q=="},"nodes":[{"id":"UCE_lALOKDql7s6MWJkozk_kX_I","createdAt":"2024-09-17T06:13:29Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T06:13:29Z","editedAt":"2024-09-17T06:13:29Z","editor":{"login":"ganluo960214","url":"https://github.com/ganluo960214"},"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"diff":"and if init Granted permisson, it will execute.\r\n```kotlin\r\nval context = LocalPlatformContext.current\r\n  val imagePickerLauncher = rememberFilePickerLauncher(\r\n    type = FilePickerFileType.Image,\r\n    selectionMode = FilePickerSelectionMode.Multiple,\r\n    onResult = { files ->\r\n      scope.launch {\r\n        files.firstOrNull()?.readByteArray(context)\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  )\r\n  val videoPickerLauncher = rememberFilePickerLauncher(\r\n    type = FilePickerFileType.Video,\r\n    selectionMode = FilePickerSelectionMode.Single,\r\n    onResult = { files ->\r\n      scope.launch {\r\n        files.firstOrNull()?.readByteArray(context)\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  )\r\n\r\n  val onPermissionResult:(\r\n    permissionState:PermissionState,\r\n    success: ()->Unit\r\n  )->Unit = { permissionState, success ->\r\n    if (permissionState.status.isGranted) {\r\n      success()\r\n      closeAfterHide{}\r\n    } else {\r\n      if (permissionState.status.shouldShowRationale){\r\n        permissionState.openAppSettings()\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  // 相机权限\r\n  val cameraPermission = rememberPermissionState(\r\n    permission = Permission.Camera,\r\n  )\r\n  LaunchedEffect(cameraPermission.status){\r\n    onPermissionResult(cameraPermission){\r\n      println(\"打开相机\")\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  // 相册图片权限\r\n  val galleryImagePermission = rememberPermissionState(\r\n    permission = Permission.Gallery,\r\n  )\r\n  LaunchedEffect(galleryImagePermission.status){\r\n    onPermissionResult(galleryImagePermission){\r\n      imagePickerLauncher.launch()\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  // 相册视频权限\r\n  val galleryVideoPermission = rememberPermissionState(\r\n    permission = Permission.Gallery,\r\n  )\r\n  LaunchedEffect(galleryVideoPermission.status){\r\n    println(\"1111111111111111111\")\r\n    onPermissionResult(galleryVideoPermission){\r\n      videoPickerLauncher.launch()\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n```"},{"id":"UCE_lALOKDql7s6MWJkozk_kX_E","createdAt":"2024-09-17T06:13:29Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T06:13:29Z","editedAt":"2024-09-17T06:12:49Z","editor":{"login":"ganluo960214","url":"https://github.com/ganluo960214"},"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"diff":"and if init Granted permisson, it will execute."}]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6MXKTp","createdAt":"2024-09-17T08:31:10Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T08:32:05Z","publishedAt":"2024-09-17T08:31:10Z","lastEditedAt":"2024-09-17T08:32:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"editor":{"login":"ganluo960214","url":"https://github.com/ganluo960214"},"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":2,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpHOT-cBlA=="},"nodes":[{"id":"UCE_lALOKDql7s6MXKTpzk_nAZY","createdAt":"2024-09-17T08:32:05Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T08:32:05Z","editedAt":"2024-09-17T08:32:05Z","editor":{"login":"ganluo960214","url":"https://github.com/ganluo960214"},"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"diff":"> If the permission is not granted you should call `launchPermissionRequest()` instead of `openAppSettings()`\r\n\r\nwhen the application already granted the permisson, the code in LaunchedEffect  will be executed by init."},{"id":"UCE_lALOKDql7s6MXKTpzk_nAZQ","createdAt":"2024-09-17T08:32:05Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T08:32:05Z","editedAt":"2024-09-17T08:31:10Z","editor":{"login":"ganluo960214","url":"https://github.com/ganluo960214"},"deletedAt":null,"deletedBy":null,"diff":"```\r\n\r\n> If the permission is not granted you should call `launchPermissionRequest()` instead of `openAppSettings()`\r\n\r\nwhen the application already granted the permisson, the code in LaunchedEffect  will be executed by init."}]}},{"__typename":"IssueComment","id":"IC_kwDOKDql7s6MXKlF","createdAt":"2024-09-17T08:31:40Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-17T08:31:40Z","publishedAt":"2024-09-17T08:31:40Z","lastEditedAt":null,"includesCreatedEdit":false,"editor":null,"userContentEdits":{"totalCount":0,"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null},"nodes":[]}}],"rateLimit":{"cost":1,"remaining":4697,"resetAt":"2026-10-24T15:26:27Z"}}}